{"id": 10000551, "reference": "A12/00203/20", "publication_date": "2020-02-06T15:30:17.883Z", "modification_date": "2020-07-23T08:45:27.063Z", "country": "Luxembourg", "product_category": "TOYS", "product_name": "Soft toy", "product_name_specific": null, "risk_description": "The product has small pieces (handle of zipper and nose) that can be easily detached.\nA small child might put them in the mouth and choke on them\n\nThe battery compartment and inside of the toy can be opened without the need of a tool, leaving easily detachable small pieces of cables, electronic components and stuffing accessible.\nA small child may put them in the mouth and choke or suffer injuries.\n\nThe accessible inner cable of the product is too long.\nThe cable may become trapped around the neck area of the child and lead to strangulation.\n\nThe accessible inner cables of the toy contain an excessive amount of bis(2-ethylhexyl) phthalate (DEHP) and di-‘isononyl’ phthalate (DINP)(measured values up to: 7 % and 0.22 % by weight, respectively).\nThese phthalates may harm the health of children, causing possible damage to their reproductive system and liver.\n\n", "legal_provision": "The product does not comply with the REACH Regulation, the requirements of the Toy Safety Directive and the relevant European standards EN 71-1 and EN 62115.", "country_of_origin": "People's Republic of China", "sold_online": "YES", "notification_type": "ARTICLE_12", "brands": [], "model_types": ["G97903  0999//1/N0"], "risk_types": ["CHEMICAL", "CHOKING", "STRANGULATION"], "measures": ["REMOVAL_FROM_ONLINE_MARKETPLACE"], "embedding_model": "siglip2-b16-256", "embedding_dim": 768, "photos": [{"photo_id": 10004645, "main": true, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10004646, "main": false, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10004647, "main": false, "embedding": ""}]}